  "id": "motor-coordination",
  "term": "motor coordination",
  "definition": "Motor coordination is the integrated working together of the nervous system and the musculoskeletal system to produce movement. In children, it is a broad physical ability that combines different movement skills and is closely linked with neurological maturation and with language, cognitive, and emotional development.",
